  "title": {
   "en": "Meta Love"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "メタラブ"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Nozomu is a university student with the ability to hear people’s “desire”. As a result, he’s lived an easy life, never being disliked by anyone. He does whatever he wants with his girlfriend Mebae, and she still adores him! One day, however, a university lecturer named Sono Nozomi appears, and her “desire” is completely inaudible to Nozomu. Nozomi’s “desire” becomes a point of obsession for him, causing his once-carefree life to unravel around him!\n\nWhat even is “desire,” anyways?"
  },
